{"5125200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drainer", "steam_appid": 5125200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5127560], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>An evil tyrant has grown powerful by draining the life from his people. Take control of his heart, find him, and punish him for his sins.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Action-packed levels filled with unique enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Challenging yet rewarding bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Special rooms with fun and unexpected challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Handcrafted rooms, procedurally connected into unique levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Stylized pixel art with a grim atmosphere</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HP Is Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Drainer:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Your ammunition drains HP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Maximum HP is used as currency</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Some enemies steal your HP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Some enemies can damage your maximum HP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Every shot, upgrade, and hit forces you to make a choice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How much HP are you willing to sacrifice to survive?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>An evil tyrant has grown powerful by draining the life from his people. Take control of his heart, find him, and punish him for his sins.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Action-packed levels filled with unique enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Challenging yet rewarding bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Special rooms with fun and unexpected challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Handcrafted rooms, pr